he is always busy, but nevertheless, she is looking for a good boyfriend, trying to make the protagonist fall in love with her. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/440640/extras/c85144189a466d6f2e5be3bf0bf91c1b.avif?t=1704493840\" /></div>Alice.<br>A tragic character. A sweet, shy girl in a strange living situation. Serge and Alice have been in the same class since 1st grade but don\u2019t know each other. At some point, the hero notices her and tries to help. Saving the girl is not easy: a terrifying secret comes to light.<br><br><br>Legal Disclaimers:<br>All characters are 18 age  or older even if specified otherwise<br><br>This game contains violence, obscene scenes (partially naked girls and flirting scenes with sexual overtones.), Rude humor, blood, scenes that depict smoking, or infrequent use of profanity.",
